//
//   (IsCompletePrefix branch): CloseConstrainedSpan sets insideConstrainedOut := false,
//     making the implication vacuously true. ✓
//
//   (EOS inside span branch): CloseSpanWithinBudget postcondition guarantees
//     `ci ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(cc)` before we break. ✓
//
//   (normal constrained step branch): SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep hard-masks to
//     parser-valid next tokens plus EOS; returns either EOS (handled separately) or a
//     valid next token. AppendConstrainedToken preserves parser validity. ✓
//
//   (final cleanup): Same CloseSpanWithinBudget postcondition argument. ✓
